    <div class="mini"><h3>3. Compute it yourself</h3><p>The algorithm is open-source: India Post has published the exact encoding code in its <a href="https://www.indiapost.gov.in/documents/offerings/intiatives/DIGIPIN_Technical_document.pdf" rel="noopener" target="_blank">technical document</a>. Any developer can build a DIGIPIN tool — no licence needed.</p></div>
