    <div><b>SKM Studio Network editorial team</b> · This page is researched and verified against the official India Post
    DIGIPIN documentation (links above). The tool runs the Department of Posts' published open-source algorithm entirely in your
    browser — your location never leaves your device. Spotted an error? <a href="/">Tell us via the Report an Issue button on any pincode page</a>.</div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer class="site">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p><a class="brand" href="/">📮 India Pincode Directory</a></p>
    <p class="note">6 lakh villages, panchayats & pincodes of India — with LGD codes, census data and DIGIPIN.</p>
